# emath-epic-machine-fjxh.1 negative seed.
#
# Scenario: a capability cell applies `Undeclared`, a capability that was
# never admitted to the package capability arena. Silent success would be a
# MeaningID hashed over a dangling capability reference.
#
# expect: MeaningError::MissingCapability - a typed refusal at the emath-ir
# seam (SemanticPackage::meaning_id), never a silent identity over a
# dangling capability application.
use std.kinds.capability

emath capability Softmax:
    inputs:
        x: Float64
    outputs:
        value: Float64
    definitions:
        value = Undeclared(x)
